# Pinned host key of the OVH VPS deploy port (2222). Host key pinning prevents
# MITM: the deploy workflow connects with StrictHostKeyChecking=yes and this
# file as UserKnownHostsFile, so a changed host key fails the deploy instead of
# silently trusting it.
#
# Regenerate only when the VPS host key is legitimately rotated:
#   ssh-keyscan -p 2222 51.222.36.17 > deploy/known_hosts.deploy
[51.222.36.17]:2222 ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIE3yd8yJeLb+BIwCOpRyHLy5Z7hRiLmGHuFc6ynR59hL
